# Tests live in __tests__

Put every Vitest file in a `__tests__` directory next to the module it covers. Name the file after that module.

```ts
// features/catalog/api/__tests__/fetchProduct.test.ts
import { fetchProduct } from '../fetchProduct'
```

```ts
// ❌ colocating the test next to the module
// features/catalog/api/fetchProduct.test.ts
```

`tsconfig.app.json` excludes `src/**/__tests__/*`. A test outside that folder is type-checked with the app.
